msgid "What this site is"
msgstr "这是什么网站"

msgid ""
"An automatically updated tracker of cyber attack activity related to the People's Republic of "
"China, in both directions: campaigns by China-attributed threat actors, and attacks against "
"targets inside China. It is a personal research tool; nothing here is original attribution "
"research."
msgstr "一个自动更新的追踪站，收录与中华人民共和国相关的网络攻击活动，覆盖两个方向：被归因于中国的攻击组织的对外行动，以及针对中国境内目标的攻击。这是个人研究工具，站内没有任何原创归因研究。"

msgid "How it works"
msgstr "运作方式"

msgid "Fetch"
msgstr "抓取"

msgid ""
"the pipeline pulls the latest articles from public security sources (vendor research blogs, "
"government advisories, security news) via RSS, in English and Chinese."
msgstr "管线通过 RSS 从公开安全来源（厂商研究博客、政府通告、安全新闻）拉取最新文章，中英文都有。"

msgid ""
"articles are pre-screened by keywords: the names and aliases of China-attributed groups imported "
"from MITRE ATT&CK, plus geographic terms. Matching articles become candidates."
msgstr "按关键词预筛文章：从 MITRE ATT&CK 导入的中国系组织名称与别名，加上地域词。命中的文章成为候选。"

msgid "Filter"
msgstr "粗筛"

msgid "Extract"
msgstr "提取"

msgid ""
"each candidate article is read by an LLM, which records every attack it describes in a fixed "
"schema: actor, victim country and sector, date, direction, MITRE ATT&CK techniques, and a "
"confidence level. Malformed answers are rejected, and irrelevant articles yield no incidents."
msgstr ""
"每篇候选文章由大语言模型阅读，把文中描述的每起攻击按固定结构记录：攻击组织、受害国家与行业、日期、方向、MITRE ATT&CK "
"技术编号、置信度。格式不合规的回答会被拒绝；与主题无关的文章不产生任何事件。"

msgid "Publish"
msgstr "发布"

msgid ""
"the database is rendered into this static site in three languages. Every incident links back to "
"the article it came from."
msgstr "数据库被渲染成这个三语静态网站。每起事件都能链接回它的来源文章。"

