msgid "Reading the data"
msgstr "如何解读数据"

msgid ""
"This site aggregates public reporting. Every claim carries the confidence its source stated, and "
"should be checked against the linked original before being relied on. Coverage is only as good as"
" the source list: Chinese-language sources are currently under-represented, so the \"against "
"China\" direction is sparse."
msgstr "本站是公开报道的聚合。每条结论都标注来源给出的置信度，采信前请点开原文核对。覆盖面取决于来源清单：目前中文来源偏少，因此\"针对中国\"方向的数据较稀疏。"

msgid "Content policy"
msgstr "内容政策"

msgid ""
"Only titles, metadata and our own short summaries are published here. Full article text is never "
"republished; follow the source links for the originals."
msgstr "本站只发布标题、元数据和我们自己撰写的简短摘要，绝不转载文章全文；原文请通过来源链接查看。"

